6330..6406 Comment "/// Function extensionality from a homotopy, through the path space: the map"
6407..6481 Comment "/// takes a point to both functions\' results there and the homotopy\'s path"
6482..6558 Comment "/// between them. Its first end reads the first result, a returned call, and"
6559..6633 Comment "/// a returned call is the call it holds, so the end is `f`; the second is"
6634..6642 Comment "/// `g`."
